    "tpc_seq": 1,
    "tpc_book": "<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<div>Coursera課程: Google Data Analytics &ndash; Course 7&nbsp;Data Analysis with R Programming</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div>金融科技實戰:R語言與量化投資。蔡立耑著，博碩。</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>Analyzing Financial Data and Implementing Financial Models Using R, 2/E, Clifford S. Ang.</li>\n\t<li>Python 初學特訓班:從快速入門到主流應用全面實戰。文淵閣工作室編著 ，碁峯。</li>\n\t<li>Python資料分析:用Pandas, Numpy和IPython做資料分析。Wes McKinney著，張靜雯譯，碁峯。</li>\n</ol>\n",
    "tpc_book_en": "Analyzing financial data and implementing financial models using R"
  },
